sanctioned: this program uses Std.Db kernels (Db.open / Db.withTransaction / Db.exec / Db.query / Db.queryDecode / Db.insertRow / Db.getById / Db.updateById / Db.deleteById / Db.migrate / Db.insertFields / Db.updateFields / Db.Decode.*) — the Go backend emits Go+SQLite (cgo) binaries while Ipê emits Rust+sqlx; the SQLite in-memory connection-pool behaviour and row-type representation differ enough that a shared Main.ipe cannot run on both backends. Ipê's output is the correct reference.
